{"notebook":"nb1","page":15,"seed":15,"says":"You asked two things of the letter pages ago: fight it, and address the envelope. Both now. The postscript gets a false start struck out, then a first attempt written in full and rubbed away, then the true version written over the scuff. Below it the envelope lies on the dark desk under the lamp, addressed, stamped, three passes of desk around it. So I have decided to send it. I think your nagging about the blank envelope decided that. The face in the glass stays unglazed and faceless, though. I said I know that person more or less. Less, this evening.","before":{"length":115.06522363823643,"worn":0.12173038354377645,"eraser":9.402221341817596,"sharpenings":21,"graphite":16.259293607449017,"distance":393507.4089161322},"after":{"length":109.45689327205642,"worn":1.5021044856554446,"eraser":9.164151984326503,"sharpenings":23,"graphite":17.817157288916793,"distance":443380.642694605},"stats":{"strokeM":49.87323377847205,"graphite":1.5578636814674443,"used":5.608330366180013,"sharpenings":2,"erasedMm2":2167,"coverage":0.06915059234180782,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"sharpen"},{"op":"write","text":"7:15. P.S.","x":14,"y":22,"size":7},{"op":"write","text":"P.S. I was going to say","font":"script","x":14,"y":34,"size":7,"pressure":0.95},{"op":"line","x1":13,"y1":31.6,"x2":92,"y2":31.2,"pressure":1.3,"repeat":2},{"op":"write","text":"P.S. I still have the key. I told you","font":"script","x":17,"y":43,"size":7,"pressure":1.6,"repeat":3},{"op":"write","text":"I had lost it. I do not know why.","font":"script","x":17,"y":51,"size":7,"pressure":1.6,"repeat":3},{"op":"erase","x":12,"y":38.6,"w":124,"h":13.5},{"op":"sharpen"},{"op":"write","text":"P.S. The key to the old door is on","font":"script","x":14,"y":42,"size":7,"pressure":1.05},{"op":"write","text":"my desk. Come for it or do not.","font":"script","x":14,"y":50,"size":7,"pressure":1.05},{"op":"write","text":"It is yours either way.","font":"script","x":14,"